.TH LOOKUP_DCOOKIE 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
lookup_dcookie \- resolves a kernel directory-entry cookie where supported and authorized; the interface is primarily for profiling
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/syscall_extra.h>
.B ssize_t lookup_dcookie(unsigned long cookie, char* buffer, size_t size);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Resolves a kernel directory-entry cookie where supported and authorized; the interface is primarily for profiling.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR lookup_dcookie (2)
